## 📁 Single Source of Truth File Structure
````text
DayXX - <Task Name>/
├── README.md                 # Comprehensive hands-on manual & screenshot workspace
├── task.md                   # Daily problem, objective, failure challenge & architecture
├── step.md                   # MANDATORY step-by-step implementation & code guide
├── execution.md              # Verified terminal run logs, failure injection & telemetry JSON
├── caption.txt               # Ultra-professional 2026 LinkedIn post with dedicated project link slot
├── caption.md                # Formatted markdown version of LinkedIn post
├── image-prompts.md          # Technical prompts and specifications for all 5 editorial visuals
├── checklist.md              # Production readiness, pre-flight & verification checklist
├── screenshots/              # Dedicated user hands-on practical screenshots workspace (.gitkeep)
├── image_01_hero.jpg         # Visual 1: Cinematic 3D Hero Environment
├── image_02_architecture.jpg # Visual 2: Isometric Cloud Architecture Topology
├── image_03_concept.jpg      # Visual 3: Production Code & Concept Visualization
├── image_04_execution.jpg    # Visual 4: Terminal Command Line & Live Telemetry
├── image_05_debug_result.jpg # Visual 5: Failure Trap, Debugging & Root Cause Analysis
├── slide_01_cover.svg        # Slide 1: 1080x1080 Project Cover & Objective
├── slide_02_architecture.svg # Slide 2: 1080x1080 End-to-End System Architecture
├── slide_03_code.svg         # Slide 3: 1080x1080 Production Code Pattern & CLI
├── slide_04_debug.svg        # Slide 4: 1080x1080 Break & Debug Root Cause Analysis
├── slide_05_summary.svg      # Slide 5: 1080x1080 Machine Telemetry JSON & Takeaways
└── linkedin_graphic.svg      # Master high-resolution infographic (1200x630)
````

